  "id": "once-upon-a-wasteland-a-fallout-story",
  "title": "Once Upon A Wasteland: A Fallout Story",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Once upon a time, twenty-seven years after the bombs fell, there were two people: a Vault Dweller and a California girl. They met, and sparks flew. That's when things got interesting. This is their story. Join us as we follow the story of Elizabeth Kirby and Odessa Valdez - the spy and the Scribe - as they search for their \"happily ever after\" in the post-apocalyptic wasteland of Fallout 76. Their love affair blossoms as they race against the clock to try to solve a mystery that threatens not only the future of Appalachia, but the rest of what remains of civilization. Starring Letitia Lemon as Elizabeth Kirby and Vitriol Plays as Odessa Valdez. Our Patreon page is now live: https://patreon.com/onceuponawasteland We've been featured by Bethesda in a Community Spotlight article. Check it out here: https://fallout.bethesda.net/en/article/3AX4SlRcAT2rRbNPg0S6xX/fallout-76-community-spotlight-once-upon-a-wasteland Nine-time Signal Award winner! Contact us - info@onceuponawasteland.com Visit us on the web: https://onceuponawasteland.com IMDb: https://www.imdb.com/title/tt18245354/ Bluesky: https://bsky.app/profile/onceuponawasteland.com Instagram: https://instagram.com/onceuponawasteland",
